  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Boil the kettle.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-13f05e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, using a vegetable peeler, slice carrot into ribbons.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt. Add carrot to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover carrot. Set aside.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. Thinly slice kale, discarding any larger pieces of stalk.\n• Finely chop garlic. Slice lime into wedges.\n• TIP: Slicing the carrot very thinly helps it pickle faster!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-ab141a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a small heatproof bowl, add peanut butter and the boiling water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people), stirring, until smooth and combined.\n• Add the low sodium soy sauce, the honey and a squeeze of lime juice. Stir to combine. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-9c9d3b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook kale until slightly wilted, 2 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a bowl, add a squeeze of lime juice and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-a28a2530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut firm tofu into 1cm-thick steaks.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine satay seasoning, a good drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper. Add tofu, turning to coat.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tofu, turning until browned, 2-3 minutes each side",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-bbbd7240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled carrot.\n• Divide roasted sweet potato, pickled carrot, cucumber, garlicky kale and satay tofu between bowls.\n• Drizzle with peanut dressing. Garnish with crushed peanuts.\n• Serve with any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83d8f6ec352636ca19122/step-f72b8750.jpg"
    }
  ]
